import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.FourthHurewiczFiveSimplexWhiskerFacetsNormal
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.FourthHurewiczFiveSimplexWhiskerFacetsLast

/-!
# Exact facet identities for a whiskered based cubical cell

Every nonexceptional facet is the original successor-indexed facet with
constant arms. The upper last facet is the concatenation of the two
rotated first facets and the original upper last facet, with its final
arm reversed. Both statements are equalities of actual native generalized
loops, for every dimension and without connectedness assumptions.
-/
